OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow      
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain         
OL,6,Fgradually eases across southwest       
OL,7,FEngland and Wales, clearing westwards. 
OL,8,FFurther rain persists across much of   
OL,9,FScotland, with strong coastal winds    
OL,10,Fand snow over the hills. Elsewhere,    
OL,11,Fremaining dry but rather cloudy, with  
OL,12,Ffog possible in Northern Ireland.      
OL,14,CWednesday:FWet to start across parts   
OL,15,Fof Northern Ireland and Scotland,      
OL,16,Fwintry across Scottish hills, turning  
OL,17,Fdrier. Brightening skies across much   
OL,18,Fof England and Wales. Feeling chilly   
OL,19,Fin an easterly breeze.                 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
